{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4Cg4AEKSajUcy2Ges6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center, dark and waiting.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*Insert it?*\n\n█████████████████████\n█████████████████████\n██                 ██\n██                 ██\n██                 ██\n██                 ██\n██       ◈         ██\n██                 ██\n██                 ██\n██                 ██\n██                 ██\n█████████████████████\n█████████████████████\n\n*The keyhole watches you like an eye.*\n\n*The metal is cold. The tumblers inside me have not turned in a very long time.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":166,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}